Launch an interactive Terminal User Interface (TUI) for managing tmux-project.

The TUI provides a visual interface for:
  - Browsing projects
  - Editing the description, type and status of a project
  - Showing the configuration directories

The name and directory of a project are shown but cannot be changed here.

Navigation:
  - Arrow keys / j,k: Move up/down
  - Enter: Edit project or field
  - s: Save project
  - r: Refresh the project list
  - c: Show configuration
  - ?, h: Help
  - Esc: Go back
  - q: Quit

Examples:
  tmux-project tui          # Launch TUI
  tmux-project tui -v       # Launch with verbose logging
